 sales over the past year, net $12.1M sold.","It returns 2.0% a year to shareholders (0.9% in buybacks and 1.1% in dividends).","The share count has grown 0.7% a year over five years, diluting existing holders."],"people":["With about 439 employees, each generates about $2.0M of revenue, 4.0x the Financial Services median, and revenue has grown 40.6% a year across its filed history.","That works out to $932K of free cash flow per employee.","The company is founder-led, which often keeps management aligned with long-term owners.","CEO pay is $5.1M (3x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores well (2/10, lower is better).","Stock compensation averages $48K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"AVOID","conv":64,"head":"Avoid: its composite score (25) is below 25.","pros":["Trades 20% below fair value of $198","ROE 20.9% vs cost of equity 8.7%","Revenue grew 39.1%/yr over 5y","P/FCF 10.2x vs sector 13.0x","Operating margin expanding 2.0%/yr"],"cons":["Composite 25, below the 25 line (gates 5/15)","P/E 19.9x vs sector 12.3x","EV/EBITDA 14.0x vs sector 10.6x"],"flags":["Its composite score (25) is below 25"],"need":[],"buy_below":168.18,"vc":{"base":197.86,"base_src":"dcf","bear":149.22,"bull":272.83,"alt_median":125.68,"n_alt":2,"gap":0.9945,"dispersion":0.1453,"level":"LOW","why":["DCF is 99% above the other models' median ($126)"]},"med":{"pe":12.2782,"ev_ebitda":10.6105,"pfcf":12.9647,"pb":1.4193,"roic":0.116,"gross_margin":0.4399,"fcf_margin":0.251,"div_yield":0.0261}},"mc_quantiles":[117.1,136.56,149.22,157.68,164.78,170.29,176.27,181.8,187.32,193.06,199.11,205.55,211.23,218.27,225.34,233.81,241.7,253.65,272.83,294.37,339.17],"mc_drivers":{"growth":0.679,"discount_rate":0.268,"terminal_growth":0.031,"exit_multiple":0.022},"ticker":"PLMR","date":"2026-11-13"}